      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    stock_price = 52\n    volatility = 0.12\n    trading_days = 252\n    z_score = 2.326\n\n    deep_itm_calls = 5000\n    deep_itm_call_delta = 1.0\n\n    deep_otm_calls = 20000\n    deep_otm_call_delta = 0.0\n\n    futures = 10000\n    futures_delta = 1.0\n\n    # Calculate the portfolio's combined delta\n    combined_delta = (\n        deep_itm_calls * deep_itm_call_delta\n        + deep_otm_calls * deep_otm_call_delta\n        + futures * futures_delta\n    )\n\n    # Calculate the 1-day standard deviation of the stock price\n    daily_price_change = stock_price * volatility / (trading_days ** 0.5)\n\n    # Calculate the 1-day 99% VaR\n    var = z_score * combined_delta * daily_price_change\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to three decimal places\n    return round(var, 3)\n```",
